  "body": "**Blocked by:** #182\n\n## Context\n\nThis issue builds on #182; #247 is the next sequential slice of the `batch-transcription` batch.\n\n## Task\n\nImplement pure deterministic merge of chunks and diarization, removing overlap duplicates into ordered {speaker,text,startsAt,endsAt} with permanent SPEAKER_nn. Call gateway.complete for selected instruction; store segments/language/summaryByInstruction declared computed keys. Set done only after committed output; use shared error path otherwise. Expose progress through generic realtime changes.\n\n## Scope\n\n### In scope\n\n- Task deliverables, migrations, integration, tests, and necessary documentation.\n\n### Out of scope\n\n- Never rewrite speaker keys after mapping.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- Merge has no duplicate overlap and monotonic times.\n- Different instructions cache distinct summaries.\n- Output and done finalize consistently.\n- Generic realtime observes changes.\n",
